※ pl4g-test: compile=fail
※ pl4g-test: expect-diag 4417 LANG_MATCH_ARM_NEVER_RUNS

※ Every alternative this one could take has been taken already, so it can
※ never be the one that runs -- which means the wildcard is not needed.

enum Colour { red ; green }
let chosen: mut Colour = Colour.red

@[startup]
fn main() → u6:
    match chosen:
        red:
            return 1u6
        green:
            return 2u6
        _:
            return 3u6
